<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 99.69 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 99.69 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 99.69 million rand worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 87.16 million rand on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
